### APIDOC: @AutoConfigureTestDatabase Annotation

Source: https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/blob/v2.7.18/spring-boot-project/spring-boot-docs/src/docs/asciidoc/features/testing.adoc

Annotation used to configure how the test database is set up. It allows overriding the default in-memory database behavior of test annotations like `@DataJpaTest` or `@JdbcTest` to connect to a real database.

```APIDOC
@AutoConfigureTestDatabase:
  Purpose: Configures the test database, overriding default in-memory setup.
  Parameters:
    - replace: AutoConfigureTestDatabase.Replace (enum)
      Description: Strategy for replacing the DataSource.
      Values:
        - ANY: Replace any DataSource with an embedded one (default).
        - NONE: Do not replace the DataSource; use the existing one (e.g., from application.properties).
        - AUTO_CONFIGURED: Replace only auto-configured embedded DataSources.
  Usage:
    @AutoConfigureTestDatabase(replace = AutoConfigureTestDatabase.Replace.NONE)
    class MyRealDbTest { ... }
```

